# Data & Evaluation Practices

## Data Sources & Management
- Training data from Open Syllabus Project API and educational resources
- Organize data in `@data/` with clear raw/processed/synthetic separation
- Maintain data lineage and processing documentation
- Version control data processing scripts, not raw datasets
- Document data collection methodology and sources

## Dataset Organization
- `@data/raw/` - Original, unmodified data
- `@data/processed/` - Cleaned and preprocessed data
- `@data/synthetic/` - Generated or augmented datasets
- Include dataset metadata and statistics
- Clear train/validation/test splits with documented rationale

## Evaluation Framework
**Technical Metrics:**
- ROUGE scores for content overlap
- BERTScore for semantic similarity
- Perplexity and coherence measures

**Educational Quality Metrics:**
- Bloom's taxonomy alignment analysis
- Pedagogical framework adherence assessment
- Learning progression coherence evaluation
- Educational structure validation

**Baseline Comparisons:**
- Compare against general-purpose LLM outputs
- Establish educational quality benchmarks
- Document evaluation methodology and criteria
